<section class="impact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="main-content">
      <div class="left-col">
        <img class="polaroid" src="https://cdn.pathedits.com/Images/pages/home/path-impact-gaibandha-children-smiling-2.png" alt="Children smiling" />
      </div>
      <div class="right-col">
        <h2>Good for business, good for the world</h2>
        <p>At Path, we believe that when done right, outsourcing can be good for everyone — not just your budget. Learn how your edits are changing lives in Gaibandha, Bangladesh through the Anisa Foundation.</p>
        <a href="https://anisafoundation.org/" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>Read our story</span>
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <hr />
        <div class="logos">
          <img src="https://cdn.pathedits.com/Logos/anisa-foundation-heart-logo.svg" alt="Anisa Foundation" class="logo-img" />
          <img src="https://cdn.pathedits.com/Logos/path-logo-dark-theme.svg" alt="Path" class="logo-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="un-card">
      <img src="https://cdn.pathedits.com/Logos/un-global-compact-logo-on-a-white-rounded-background.svg" alt="UN Global Compact" width="120" />
      <div class="un-text">
        <h3>We believe in socially conscious business</h3>
        <p>As a UN Global Compact participant, we're committed to doing business in a way that's both sustainable and socially conscious. Want to know more? Learn about the UN Global Compact and its guiding principles.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .impact {
    background: #F1EFFE;
    padding: 80px 0;
  }
  .impact .container {
    max-width: 1440px !important;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }
  .main-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .left-col {
    flex: 0 0 45%;
    max-width: 45%;
  }
  .right-col {
    flex: 0 0 50%;
    max-width: 50%;
  }
  .polaroid {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    display: block;
  }
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Livvic', sans-serif;
    color: #2B1B9A;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .right-col p {
    font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
    color: #2B1B9A;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: #67B6F4;
    color: #2B1B9A;
    font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn span {
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .btn svg {
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .btn:hover {
    background: #54A6E8;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  hr {
    border: none;
    height: 1px;
    background: #D9D4EF;
    margin: 32px 0 24px;
  }
  .logos {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 44px;
  }
  .logo-img {
    height: 54px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .un-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    padding: 32px 40px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
  }
  .un-text h3 {
    font-family: 'Livvic', sans-serif;
    color: #2B1B9A;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }
  .un-text p {
    font-family: 'Asap', sans-serif;
    color: #2B1B9A;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .main-content {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .left-col, .right-col {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .un-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
